# The Lab — live case material. This repository is public, and de-identified
# is not the same as publishable: a case that is anonymous to a stranger can
# still be obvious to the ward that treated the patient. Real submissions,
# contributor details, assembled issues and metrics stay on Brad's machine.
# Tracked under lab/ are only the templates, the fabricated test samples,
# the worked example built from them, and the allowlist.
lab/cases/
